Description: Link hyprland-share-picker against its transitive libraries
 hyprland-share-picker resolves GL, libdisplay-info and libseat symbols that
 come in through libhyprtoolkit/libaquamarine. Relying on those libraries
 recording the corresponding DT_NEEDED entries breaks on toolchains where
 --as-needed is the default for the build, leaving
 "libhyprtoolkit.so: undefined reference to `glDeleteBuffers'" and friends at
 link time.
 .
 Request the libraries explicitly through pkg-config so the link is
 self-contained.
Origin: Parrot
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-20
Index: xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland-1.5.0/hyprland-share-picker/CMakeLists.txt
===================================================================
--- xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland-1.5.0.orig/hyprland-share-picker/CMakeLists.txt
+++ xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland-1.5.0/hyprland-share-picker/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -18,6 +18,11 @@ pkg_check_modules(
   IMPORTED_TARGET
   hyprtoolkit>=0.6.0
   hyprutils>=0.2.6
+  aquamarine
+  libdisplay-info
+  libseat
+  egl
+  glesv2
   libdrm)
 
 add_executable(hyprland-share-picker main.cpp Picker.cpp PickerData.cpp
